Package: pve-fcsan
Architecture: all
Depends: libpve-storage-perl (>= 8.0),
         lvm2,
         multipath-tools,
         pve-manager (>= 8.0),
         udev,
         util-linux,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${perl:Depends},
Description: vCenter-style Fibre Channel SAN management for Proxmox VE
 Adds a 'fcsan' storage type (shared LVM on multipathed FC/iSCSI LUNs), a
 REST API under /nodes/{node}/san, the 'pvesan' CLI and a GUI panel
 (Node > Disks > SAN / Fibre Channel) to list HBAs, LUNs and paths, rescan,
 set multipath aliases and path policies, and create, grow, rename, mount,
 unmount, reclaim and delete datastores cluster-wide.
